p&w=200&h=200&s=0a632b5c204fca3add50add8c01b0b56 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello, thank you for my last uma musume Skeb!\nFor this request, I'd like you to draw an indie Vtuber I watch, Haru Mizuki!\n\nI have already obtained permission from them, and they can't wait to see this request!\n\nHere is their reference sheet and art!\nhttps://x.com/HaruMizukiCh/status/1691316360134148097\nhttps://x.com/nosharko/status/1902632386615038210\n\nCan you make their pose cute, and in your usual chubby style? I'll leave the posing to you!\n\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mahrr_mm/works/219", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e231d3a/uploads/origins/5bd3bcc1-537b-4a3a-9836-6f0a5b21d44e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c642db64e05e1769da6b32309dc0d07b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e231d3a/uploads/origins/5bd3bcc1-537b-4a3a-9836-6f0a5b21d44e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c642db64e05e1769da6b32309dc0d07b, https://si.imgix.net/9e231d3a/uploads/origins/5bd3bcc1-537b-4a3a-9836-6f0a5b21d44e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c9c0e528ee52aabd5f746067aef72f29 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e231d3a/uploads/origins/5bd3bcc1-537b-4a3a-9836-6f0a5b21d44e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b65fdb296ab1f2ee5b21b784f94a0ea2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mahrr_mm/works/218", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/69f69dbc/uploads/